{"paper": "SSC-DelhiPoliceConstable-30-Nov-2023-Shift1.pdf", "status": "ok", "mode": "sequential", "splitter": "qdot", "section_slice": true, "extracted_count": 15, "tagged_count": 15, "questions": [{"n": 1, "text": "A sum of money was lent at 12.5% rate of yearly compound interest for three years. If the present value (i.e. after three years) of the sum of money is ₹13,851, then how much money (in ₹) was lent?", "options": [{"text": "10000", "added": false}, {"text": "10278", "added": false}, {"text": "8728", "added": false}, {"text": "9728", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Compound Interest", "sub": "ci-formula", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 2, "text": "A, B and C can do a piece of work in 40, 60 and 120 days, respectively. In how many days can A do the work if he is assisted by B and C on every third day?", "options": [{"text": "30", "added": false}, {"text": "20", "added": false}, {"text": "25", "added": false}, {"text": "35", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "alternate-days", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 3, "text": "The average of 7.012, 4.018, 6.012, 4.048, and 3.91, is:", "options": [{"text": "3.5", "added": false}, {"text": "7", "added": false}, {"text": "5", "added": false}, {"text": "4.5", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "simple-average", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 4, "text": "If 184 ÷ 11.5 = 16, then 1.84 ÷ 1.15 is:", "options": [{"text": "1.6", "added": false}, {"text": "0.6", "added": false}, {"text": "1.06", "added": false}, {"text": "0.16", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 5, "text": "Find the number of lead balls, each 2 cm in diameter, that can be made from a sphere of diameter 20 cm.", "options": [{"text": "1000", "added": false}, {"text": "150", "added": false}, {"text": "1500", "added": f